<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90711" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφυλ-ᾰκή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>guard in front</i>; in pl.,
				<i>outposts, vedettes, piquets</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq. Mag.</u>
				7.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				39
			</span></i>: sg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. αὐτοῦ</span> his
				<i>advanced guard</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.1.24
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.3.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριστοποιεῖσθαι διὰ
			προφυλακῆς</span> with <i>an advanced guard</i>, with
				<i>outposts</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>guarding, guard</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πόλεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.95.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				11.2
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>watch, vigil</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				12.42
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>caution</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφυλακῇ χρῆσθαι περί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.283
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>precaution</i>, c.gen., against . ., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.368
			</span></i>, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Oxy.</u>
				215 iii 14
			</span></i>: Medic., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφυλακῆς χάριν</span>
			as a <i>precaution</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.118
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.47
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
